  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/237",
  "contentHtml": "<p>1.실험 아이템 :&#160;</p><p><b>용액의 밝기를 핸드폰으로 측정하여 농도를 측정하는 실험</b></p><p>-<b>음료제조가루</b>: 빨간색 음료제조 가루(체리 에이드)를 이용해서 서로 다른 농도(3가지)의 용액을 만듬</p><p>-<b>큐벳</b>:큐벳(흡광광도계용 용기)을 활용해서 담아서 핸드폰 밝기 측정앱로 촬영함.</p><p>-<b>Beer법칙</b>(용액의 농도가 클수록 흡광도가 큼)을 적용한 구글 스프레드시트 양식을 학생들에게 제공하여 &quot;흡광도 함수&quot;를 학생들이 얻어내도록 함.(추세선 함수 활용)</p><p>-<b>구글스프레드시트:</b>학생들은 본인들의 측정값으로 그래프를 얻고, 미지의 농도의 용액의 농도를 추정함.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/25bdce16c518869687045c4815ae9269f1067f3e\" data-origin-width=\"551\" data-origin-height=\"417\" style=\"width:63.79%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/25bdce16c518869687045c4815ae9269f1067f3e\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4b14cb6e88b17a6c457933c21b5b7fa3326e6839\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\" style=\"width:36.21%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4b14cb6e88b17a6c457933c21b5b7fa3326e6839\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\">흰색배경으로 용액의 사진을 찍는 장면</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/94b70549eccc1a51e3ea28eee63fada1dbd17f12\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"376\" height=\"262\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/94b70549eccc1a51e3ea28eee63fada1dbd17f12\" data-origin-width=\"1113\" data-origin-height=\"775\"><div class=\"figcaption\">플라스틱 큐벳</div></div><p><b>2.평가 과정</b></p><p>-과목: 과학과제연구 (2시간 블록수업)</p><p>-1일차: 2시간(활동지 배부): 원리 설명, 실험 탐구, 보고서 작성&#160;</p><p>-2일차: 1시간(평가지 배부): 실험관련 실험 탐구 논술 (실험 과정 설명, 측정값 계산 및 평가,&#160; 오차의 원인 및 개선점 논평)</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;1시간: 실험 원리의 활용 강의, 소감문 작성&#160;</p><p><b>3.실험 탐구 방법</b></p><p>아래는 활동지 입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d285a45f7c6045eb34c82fc2201991b9eccba0f1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d285a45f7c6045eb34c82fc2201991b9eccba0f1\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3129f84f553c746a1072112e530677c483c7cc5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3129f84f553c746a1072112e530677c483c7cc5\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f95312d8cc6f6ce08e8687bf58900c7fd79e092?download\" data-file-name=\"수행평가_활동지_영상기반용액농도측정.hwp\" data-file-size=\"4052992\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">수행평가_활동지_영상기반용액농도측정</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.87MB</div></div></div><p>-학생들에게 &quot;사본&quot;으로 제공된 구글 스프레드 시트</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1PmO8LdUf1LIwlS49QTQssVYc1VBdKpWgB3i9bPDZXRE/copy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1PmO8LdUf1LIwlS49QTQssVYc1VBdKpWgB3i9bPDZXRE/copy</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Google Sheets: 로그인\" data-og-description=\"이메일 또는 휴대전화\" data-og-host=\"accounts.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1PmO8LdUf1LIwlS49QTQssVYc1VBdKpWgB3i9bPDZXRE/copy\" data-og-url=\"https://accounts.google.com/v3/signin/identifier?continue=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fsp